Package: xlamisc
Title: Helper Functions for 'r-xla'
Version: 0.5.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sebastian", "Fischer", , "seb.fischer@tutamail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9609-3197")),
    person("Daniel", "Falbel", , "daniel@posit.co", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-0143-2392"))
  )
Description: Frequently used generics and helper functions used in 'anvl'
    and its companion packages 'stablehlo' and 'pjrt'. Comes with S3
    generics to query tensors (shape, data type, device) and to convert
    them to R arrays and raw vectors, as well as an enum-style class for
    tensor element types.
